# Csound render-test artifacts
*.wav
csound/effects/test_chan.wav

# EXCEPTION: the impulse responses are a HARD dependency, not an artifact.
# csound aborts at init with "soundin cannot open .../ir/<file>.wav" and the
# instrument never starts. They lived only on one Mac until 2026-10-02 -- no
# git, no remote, no backup -- which is exactly the exposure that made the
# 2026-10-01 SD-card death a six-hour rebuild instead of a ten-minute restore.
# 25 files, 15 MB, next to 7.1 MB of already-tracked NAM profiles.
# The blanket *.wav above still covers the 111 MB of samples and render tests.
!csound/ir/*.wav

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# Vendored upstream (has its own git history)
csound/nam/libs/NeuralAmpModelerCore/

# Local C++ build output (compiled .o/.so, CMake cache) — not source
csound/nam/build/
csound/nam/build-*/

# Arduino-cli build cache for the Teensy firmware — not source
TEENSYY/build/

